      </li>
      </ul>
      <h2 id="olm-mirror-catalog_olm-restricted-networks" class="group scroll-mt-20">Mirroring an Operator catalog<a href="#olm-mirror-catalog_olm-restricted-networks" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
